// Permit Read when a Scan returned score decimal("0.50") within 1h.
//
// The policy pins `output.score: decimal("0.50")` while the trace carries
// `score: 0.5`. Those are the same value written two ways, so the predicate
// must compare decimals by numeric value rather than by their serialized
// text. Expected: the Read at @2 permits.
permit (
    principal,
    action == Drupe::Action::"Read",
    resource
)
when temporal {
    formerly within 1h (Drupe::Action::"Scan"::response{ input.user: context.input.user, output.score: decimal("0.50") })
};
